msgstr "设置..."

msgid "BetterPushback Preferences"
msgstr "BetterPushback设置"

msgid "User interface"
msgstr "界面设置"

#msgid "X-Plane's language"
#msgstr "X-Plane系統語言"
#msgstr "X-Plane语言"

msgid "Ground crew audio"
msgstr "地勤人员语音"


msgid 
    "My language only at domestic airports:\n"
    "Ground crew speaks my language only if the country the airport is "
    "in speaks my language. Otherwise the ground crew speaks English "
    "with a local accent.\n\n"
    "My language at all airports:\n"
    "Ground crew speaks my language irrespective "
    "of what country the airport is in.\n\n"
    "English at all airports:\n"
    "Ground crew always speaks English "
    "with a local accent."
msgstr
"只在国内机场说中文:\n"
"地面人员只有在说中文的机场时，才会说中文，否则地勤人员会说当地口音英语.\n\n"
"所有机场说中文:\n"
"无论机场在哪个国家，地勤人员都会说中文.\n\n"
"所有机场说英文:\n"
"地勤人员总是说着带有当地口音的英语."


msgid "My language only at domestic airports"
msgstr "只在国内机场说中文"

msgid "My language at all airports"
msgstr "所有机场说中文"

msgid "English at all airports"
msgstr "所有机场说英文"

msgid "Save preferences"
msgstr "保存设置"

msgid "Ground crew speaks my language only if the country the airport is "
"in speaks my language. Otherwise the ground crew speaks English "
"with a local accent."
msgstr "地面人员只有在说中文的机场时，才会说中文，否则地勤人员会说当地口音英语"

msgid "Ground crew speaks my language irrespective of what country the "
"airport is in."
msgstr "无论机场在哪个国家，地勤人员都会说中文"

msgid "Ground crew always speaks English with a local accent."
msgstr "地勤人员总是说着带有当地口音的英语"

msgid "Save current preferences to disk."
msgstr "保存当前设置."

msgid "Disconnect tow + headset and switch to hand signals."
msgstr "断开拖杆和耳机，注意手势"

msgid "Reconnect tow and await further instructions."
msgstr "重新连接拖杆，等待指令"

msgid   "Never ask and always automatically disconnect "
        "the tug when the pushback operation is complete."
msgstr  "永远不询问，并在后推操作完成时自动断开"
        "拖车杆的连接。"

msgid   "Never check \"set parking brake\".\n"
        "Some aircraft stuck on this check.\n"
        "It's on the beginning and on the end.\n"
        "This should solve this problem for some aircrafts. (KA350 for "
        "instance)."
msgstr  "永远不要检查「设置停车刹车」。\n"
        "某些机模在这个检测中卡住。\n"
        "这在开始和结束时都会发生。\n"
        "这应该能解决某些飞机的问题（例如KA350）。"

msgid   "Select the action after the doors/GPU/ASU status check is done before starting the push-back.\n"
        "Active with ground crew message: The ground crew will tell you if the doors are not closed.\n"
        "Active, but stay silent: The ground crew will wait, but not say anything if the doors are not closed.\n"
        "Ignore: The doors/GPU/ASU status check is ignored and the push-back starts immediately, even if the doors are not closed or the GPU/ASU is still connected."
msgstr  "选择在开始推出之前完成舱门/GPU/ASU状态检查后的操作。\n"
        "启用地勤人员消息：地勤人员会告诉您如果门未关闭。\n"
        "启用，但保持静音：地勤人员将等待，但如果门未关闭则不会说任何话。\n"
        "忽略：忽略舱门/GPU/ASU状态检查，立刻开始推出，即使舱门未关闭或GPU/ASU仍连接。"

msgid   "Hides the shortcut buttons on the left side of the screen.\n"
        "The first button starts the planner and the second starts the push-"
        "back."
msgstr  "隐藏屏幕左侧的快捷按钮。\n"
        "第一个按钮启动计划生成器，第二个按钮启动后推。"

msgid   "Slide this bar to move the magic squares up or down."
msgstr  "滑动此条以向上或向下移动快捷按钮。"

msgid   "The push process is always halted when the tug is at the nose of the "
        "aircraft.\n"
        "The process will proceed by triggering again the 'start pushback' "
        "command."
msgstr  "当后推车在飞机鼻部时，后推过程会始终暂停。\n"
        "此过程将通过重新触发「开始后推」命令继续进行。"

msgid   "Hides default X-Plane 11 pushback tug.\n"
        "Restart X-Plane for this change to take effect."
msgstr  "隐藏预设的X-Plane 11后推车。\n"
        "重启X-Plane以使此配置生效。"

msgid   "Doors/GPU/ASU check"
msgstr  "检查舱门/GPU/ASU状态"

msgid   "Hide the magic squares"
msgstr  "隐藏快捷按钮。"

msgid   "Magic squares position"
msgstr  "快捷按钮位置。"

msgid   "Hide default X-Plane 11 tug"
msgstr  "隐藏预设的X-Plane 11后推车。"

msgid   "Always connect the tug first"
msgstr  "始终先连接后推车。"

msgid   "Connect tug first"
msgstr  "先连接后推车。"

msgid   "Tug cab view"
msgstr  "后推车驾驶室视角。"

msgid "Radio output device"
msgstr "无线电输出设备。"

